        "Description": "Good Afternoon, Sir.\r\rA group of Eco-Terrorists operating out of a rural homestead in Colorado recently gained access to highly confidential information regarding some of our top constituents, including major corporations, like Ether, Dynasty Global, and Milton-Fitzpatrick Bank Corp, and multiple high-profile individuals like, Arthur Edwards, The Partners, Mikhail Kadir, Geraldine Quill, and Yuki Yamazaki.\r\rDeal With It, Or Die.",
